{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "007kei_305_2_3_007_05_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:be6a59eb13636a16abd711cec557fd87eac7165b797d998b9a43e2142e155913",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:007kei_305_2_3_007_05_09_a:2_3_007_05_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3e6e5853bb65e9f1e62c18e0802747a396ce8aef7bc2352098e950891036a185",
      "text": "你好，●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:007kei_305_2_3_007_05_09_a:2_3_007_05_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b51ef1fbc18ace927eed6bca52bc5194619096e6104b223a0847a884bc33b3b4",
      "text": "之前来参加活动的孩子，\n寄了信过来哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:007kei_305_2_3_007_05_09_a:2_3_007_05_09_a:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7928ff5d6b8aeb44f0fed8c11f2a91527443ba38696b6585ef4932e02037418a",
      "text": "就是向我们提问“把喜欢的事情当作工作\n不会很痛苦吗”的那个孩子。你还记得吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:007kei_305_2_3_007_05_09_a:2_3_007_05_09_a:cmd-000012:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:30244a9cb965d053d7a2bf861a38d93150310cfd18dbb3bc4212ff49c08e235c",
      "text": "听说在跟我们聊过之后，\n似乎真的把喜欢的事情当成工作了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:007kei_305_2_3_007_05_09_a:2_3_007_05_09_a:cmd-000014:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a8519cf0086297a8ec0e355802146b62923ffa5c9259598a227ff2f7632575d3",
      "text": "告诉我虽然也有辛苦的事，\n但更多的是充实感。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:007kei_305_2_3_007_05_09_a:2_3_007_05_09_a:cmd-000016:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c0f5b9414cf2cb8a4314b53815bd341eee1f74747a512493657d30a93fff46ab",
      "text": "“谢谢你们在那时推了我一把”，\n最后这样写着呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:007kei_305_2_3_007_05_09_a:2_3_007_05_09_a:cmd-000018:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f64daeef20807a3d617e6b4eae6f667a8f9854a81241c2437e81ba09b6c1fd00",
      "text": "圭先生你们的心意\n传达到了呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:007kei_305_2_3_007_05_09_a:2_3_007_05_09_a:cmd-000021:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f15beb0ea76e7ddf12e2af74bbbe1e0fa29af6ef7a832ec0a7f79e53f846ce9d",
      "text": "是啊。能成为某人的力量真让人开心啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:007kei_305_2_3_007_05_09_a:2_3_007_05_09_a:cmd-000023:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9a44e2f0bbe67cfda1fcc4f96fe0b12add1f6a1796e0f405917c55445ed5999e",
      "text": "这也是多亏了为我们带来契机的\n●●●●プロデューサー啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:007kei_305_2_3_007_05_09_a:2_3_007_05_09_a:cmd-000025:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4aceb90bf9caef129eaea0242f66b8be5c17e4fc865be89e8646a0105c127bec",
      "text": "即使是这样的我，\n今后也愿意和我在一起吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:007kei_305_2_3_007_05_09_a:2_3_007_05_09_a:cmd-000027:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c3e0eab7135bbf0124c363d162784a0708abfe045d94917138ffb36a58b21a3",
      "text": "当然！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:007kei_305_2_3_007_05_09_a:2_3_007_05_09_a:cmd-000028:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a6fe2a2959cc37f24cdd79308cb9dc669b4cd9c1650e2bc8bb12ed742fa7f0b",
      "text": "好的！今后也\n请多多关照！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:007kei_305_2_3_007_05_09_a:2_3_007_05_09_a:cmd-000031:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4098deb1d8a8922528a101fffa245ddce93acc414e99e625ec8bda9601e87d0",
      "text": "嗯，谢谢你。那就回头见啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
